    "body": "This looks fine for the requestDevice path, but you aren't registering an inputreport listener in the getDevices path.\r\n\r\nWhich version of Chrome are you using? There were some recent changes to allow USB HID permissions to be remembered. That means you should only see the chooser dialog once per (origin, device) pair, and afterward it should be included in getDevices until the permission is revoked.",
