    "body": "I didn't know I had to register an inputreport listener in the getDevices path. Can you please elaborate on this?\r\n\r\nI have registered it after connecting the device:\r\n`device.addEventListener('inputreport', handleInputReport);`\r\nand I am able to receive data from my HID device if I don't send any data just before receiving it.\r\n\r\nI am using Chrome Version 83.0.4103.106 (Official Build) (64-bit). My OS is Mac OS Catalina.",
