    "body": "Try modifying getOpenedDevice to set the event listener when it opens the device:\r\n\r\n```\r\nasync function getOpenedDevice() {\r\n  const devices = await navigator.hid.getDevices();\r\n  let device = devices.find(d => d.vendorId === vendorId && d.productId === productId);\r\n\r\n  if (!device) {\r\n    device = await navigator.hid.requestDevice({\r\n      filters: [{ vendorId, productId }],\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  if (!device.opened) {\r\n    await device.open();\r\n\r\n    // If the device was closed then the listener hasn't been registered yet.\r\n    device.addEventListener('inputreport', handleInputReport);\r\n  }\r\n  return device;\r\n}\r\n```",
